WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.106 --> 00:00:04.042
- Whip!

00:00:04.185 --> 00:00:05.023
Nae nae!

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:15.112
I have six grandchildren
and that is what I'm saying.

00:00:15.112 --> 00:00:16.156
And I'm sticking to it.

00:00:17.152 --> 00:00:19.066
- I am indeed a grandmother of one.

00:00:19.066 --> 00:00:20.443
- I am a grandmother of 17.

00:00:22.887 --> 00:00:24.548
I was thinking the twist, for me.

00:00:26.268 --> 00:00:28.110
- Remember mashed potatoes?

00:00:28.763 --> 00:00:29.482
Mashed potatoes.

00:00:29.482 --> 00:00:31.111
- I used to be a closet dancer,

00:00:31.111 --> 00:00:33.490
and so I would move to the music

00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:34.884
whatever the music was.

00:00:39.509 --> 00:00:41.494
You're going to pick up your right leg.

00:00:41.494 --> 00:00:42.289
Whip.

00:00:42.783 --> 00:00:44.124
And then nae nae is,

00:00:44.124 --> 00:00:46.127
you're going to put your opposite hand up.

00:00:46.654 --> 00:00:49.041
And you're going to go back, like this.

00:00:49.228 --> 00:00:50.025
Yeah.

00:00:50.417 --> 00:00:53.217
Kind of like in a snake-like motion.

00:00:53.217 --> 00:00:54.052
Yeah, exactly.

00:00:54.542 --> 00:00:55.350
Yeah, okay awesome.

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:56.309
- It's like riding a horse.

00:00:56.505 --> 00:00:57.333
- You guys are awesome.

00:00:57.803 --> 00:00:59.606
- Whip, whip

00:00:59.606 --> 00:01:01.829
and then nae nae on the second one.

00:01:01.829 --> 00:01:02.457
- Exactly, yeah.

00:01:02.457 --> 00:01:03.403
- There's no nae nae in-between.

00:01:03.403 --> 00:01:06.360
- No it's whip, whip.

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:08.387
Like you're falling.

00:01:08.387 --> 00:01:09.155
But don't fall.

00:01:09.155 --> 00:01:09.673
- Okay.

00:01:09.673 --> 00:01:11.279
- Do you have any idea
why it's called nae nae?

00:01:11.279 --> 00:01:12.234
So I could do it together with...

00:01:12.234 --> 00:01:14.280
- Um, I don't know actually.

00:01:14.281 --> 00:01:16.860
And you can kinda like,
put your own style on it.

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:19.103
Yeah, exactly.

00:01:22.003 --> 00:01:23.869
- You already know what it is!

00:01:42.938 --> 00:01:43.948
Doin' it wrong.

00:01:47.578 --> 00:01:50.596
I'm going to do it in the
closet until I get better at it.

00:01:50.596 --> 00:01:51.768
- I think it's great.

00:01:51.768 --> 00:01:52.751
I think it's really fun.

00:01:52.751 --> 00:01:54.829
I mean it's like line dancing
and that's really fun.

00:01:54.829 --> 00:01:57.785
- I was thinking similar,
the Slop, the Madison,

00:01:57.785 --> 00:02:00.215
I love a lot more than these steps.

00:02:00.215 --> 00:02:02.278
- I think i'm going to
teach all the grandchildren.

00:02:02.278 --> 00:02:04.738
- [Interviewer] Have you
ever heard of twerking?

00:02:04.918 --> 00:02:06.678
- I have heard of twerking.

00:02:06.678 --> 00:02:11.678
I think that the word twerking
comes from working your twat.

